  <Docs>
    <summary>Controls the technique and cost of the rescaling that is performed during an asynchronous rescale-and-read operation.</summary>
    <remarks>Used with <see cref="M:SkiaSharp.SKImage.RequestReadPixels(SkiaSharp.SKImageInfo,SkiaSharp.SKRectI,SkiaSharp.SKImageRescaleGamma,SkiaSharp.SKImageRescaleMode,System.Action{SkiaSharp.SKImageReadPixelsResult})" /> to select the filtering technique used when the requested output size differs from the source sub-rectangle. Higher-quality modes produce smoother results at greater cost.</remarks>
